 so Claire runs to the kitchen hitting  Rita's head repeatedly until her system  is damaged Rita is finally willing to  open the door but her battery is running  low with her remaining energy she  immediately drags her body towards the  door and uses her Palm to open the door  the door is finally unlocked and Claire  finally is able to breathe fresh air  it's then revealed that Helen's story  was never accepted after finding out  that her daughter is lying she beats her  up so her daughter decides to escape  from the house  sometimes later the daughter returns to  the house only to find that her mother  has committed suicide she goes upstairs  and unlocks Helen's box which contains  two scripts inside it she subsequently  leaves the house and the stories  eventually become Claire's best seller  books  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

